Source: print.inc
     1 				; File > Print to P: (overlay image R, id 5). Format of the output and the limits: docs/PRINT.md.
     2 				; Modes (first letter typed at the prompt): t plain text, e Epson ESC/P text, b bitmap 60 dpi, d bitmap 120 dpi.
     3 				; The document is read straight from DOC; every output byte goes through outb into a buffer in LDB, which is sent
     4 				; with CIO put-chars on IOCB 4. No byte of graphics data is $9B (the OS handler ends a frame at EOL).
     5 = 001B			ESC = 27
     6 = 000C			FF  = 12
     7 = 0040			IOP = $40
