     3 58D8 52 65 61 64 73 20 +  dta c'Reads a plain text or ATASCII file and turns it into an',b(13)
     4 5910 41 43 57 72 69 74 +  dta c'ACWriter document. It replaces the document in memory.',b(13)
     5 5947 20 2D 20 6C 69 6E +  dta c' - lines wrap at 64 columns (soft breaks)',b(13)
     6 5971 20 2D 20 69 6E 76 +  dta c' - inverse video becomes underline',b(13)
     7 5994 20 2D 20 43 74 72 +  dta c' - Ctrl-C at the start of a line centres it',b(13)
     8 59C0 20 2D 20 6F 74 68 +  dta c' - other control codes are dropped',b(13)
     9 59E3 0D			 dta b(13)
    10 59E4 50 72 65 73 73 20 +  dta c'Press I or Return, then type the file name. The default',b(13)
    11 5A1C 64 65 76 69 63 65 +  dta c'device is D1:  H:NAME works in the emulator.',b(13)
    12 5A49 46 69 6C 65 20 3E +  dta c'File > Open does the same for any file that is not an',b(13)
    13 5A7F 41 43 57 72 69 74 +  dta c'ACWriter (CRFT) file.',b(13)
    14 5A95 0D			 dta b(13)
    15 5A96 4C 65 74 74 65 72 +  dta c'Letter Perfect, PaperClip, Text Wizard, Bank Street,',b(13)
    16 5ACB 52 54 46 20 61 6E +  dta c'RTF and Word files: convert on the PC first with',b(13)
    17 5AFC 20 20 6E 6F 64 65 +  dta c'  node tools/craftimport.cjs INPUT OUTPUT.XCW',b(13)
    18 5B2A 54 68 65 6E 20 70 +  dta c'Then press E to edit the result.',b(13)
